    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/fe6c6bbf18c58ed73565648232b994b9.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/fe6c6bbf18c58ed73565648232b994b9.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/fe6c6bbf18c58ed73565648232b994b9.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor is new experience. <strong>Solve intricate puzzles</strong>, <strong>complete quests</strong>, <strong>search\u00a0for tools</strong>. Be careful\u2014there are traps, scary creatures, and surprises around every corner. Stay sharp, work with your friends, and push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/5224d76190c0998bb97a94cee2714d5e.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/5224d76190c0998bb97a94cee2714d5e.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/5224d76190c0998bb97a94cee2714d5e.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/67eea60651cefdb1a16c01d4063614c9.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/67eea60651cefdb1a16c01d4063614c9.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/67eea60651cefdb1a16c01d4063614c9.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them can hear even the slightest sound, so be careful. Watch the noise you make, and don\u2019t speak too loudly when they\u2019re near.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/dd332b17b8c4926c0dfbc5b7c3bcd922.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/dd332b17b8c4926c0dfbc5b7c3bcd922.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/dd332b17b8c4926c0dfbc5b7c3bcd922.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/8efa86e734fe21012f7a743f94c8a48d.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/8efa86e734fe21012f7a743f94c8a48d.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/8efa86e734fe21012f7a743f94c8a48d.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask somone to help you , it's better to not go alone . The danger is always there , and it's better to handle it\u00a0 together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/fe6c6bbf18c58ed73565648232b994b9.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/fe6c6bbf18c58ed73565648232b994b9.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/fe6c6bbf18c58ed73565648232b994b9.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor is new experience. <strong>Solve intricate puzzles</strong>, <strong>complete quests</strong>, <strong>search\u00a0for tools</strong>. Be careful\u2014there are traps, scary creatures, and surprises around every corner. Stay sharp, work with your friends, and push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/5224d76190c0998bb97a94cee2714d5e.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/5224d76190c0998bb97a94cee2714d5e.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/5224d76190c0998bb97a94cee2714d5e.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/67eea60651cefdb1a16c01d4063614c9.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/67eea60651cefdb1a16c01d4063614c9.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/67eea60651cefdb1a16c01d4063614c9.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them can hear even the slightest sound, so be careful. Watch the noise you make, and don\u2019t speak too loudly when they\u2019re near.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/dd332b17b8c4926c0dfbc5b7c3bcd922.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/dd332b17b8c4926c0dfbc5b7c3bcd922.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/dd332b17b8c4926c0dfbc5b7c3bcd922.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/8efa86e734fe21012f7a743f94c8a48d.poster.avif?t=1746368561\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/8efa86e734fe21012f7a743f94c8a48d.webm?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/8efa86e734fe21012f7a743f94c8a48d.mp4?t=1746368561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask somone to help you , it's better to not go alone . The danger is always there , and it's better to handle it\u00a0 together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
